{"title":"2024 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2024 AMC 10A #1</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2024 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">2024 AMC 12A #1</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Direct_Computation)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Direct Computation)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Distributive_Property)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Distributive Property)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Solution_1_but_Distributive)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Solution 1 but Distributive)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_(Modular_Arithmetic)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 (Modular Arithmetic)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5_(Process_of_Elimination)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5 (Process of Elimination)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_6_(Faster_Distribution)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 6 (Faster Distribution)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Solution_7_(Cubes)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 7 (Cubes)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Solution_8_(Super_Fast)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 8 (Super Fast)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Solution_9_(Estimation)_*🔥VERY_FAST🔥*\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 9 (Estimation) *🔥VERY FAST🔥*</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Solution_10\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 10</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Solution_11_(Fastest)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 11 (Fastest)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_DDM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution DDM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution(Don&#39;t_do_the_actual_computation-_be_fast_by_taking_mods!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">15</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution(Don't do the actual computation- be fast by taking mods!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Central_Valley_Math_Circle\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">16</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Central Valley Math Circle</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(⚡️_1_min_solve_⚡️)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">17</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (⚡️ 1 min solve ⚡️)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-18\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Pi_Academy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">18</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Pi Academy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-19\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_FrankTutor\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">19</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by FrankTutor</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-20\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_by_Power_Solve\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">20</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 by Power Solve</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-21\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SpreadTheMathLove\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">21</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-22\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Math_from_my_desk\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">22</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Math from my desk</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-23\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">23</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-24\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Dr._David\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">24</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Dr. David</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-25\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_yjtest_(2_Solutions,_Good_Approaches_for_Competitions)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">25</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by yjtest (2 Solutions, Good Approaches for Competitions)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-26\"><a href=\"#Video_solution_by_TheNeuralMathAcademy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">26</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-27\"><a href=\"#Video_solution_by_MaffyTaffy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">27</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video solution by MaffyTaffy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-28\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">28</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/5/a854d1a9a5672729a0cd5f1c58e35c196dc6cb19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9901\\cdot101-99\\cdot10101?$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"186\" height=\"16\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/98621ec5cbafd79bb4e0e1bb1d6852a3b014c4c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}~2\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}~20\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}~200\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}~202\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}~2020$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"424\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Direct_Computation.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Direct_Computation)\">Solution 1 (Direct Computation)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Direct Computation)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The likely fastest method will be direct computation. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/4/1b4f08ae8c0e1906dcab51dfa206e34414a253e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9901\\cdot101$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"14\" /> evaluates to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/0/b30bb80ded7f23293bad0c97c963836ce040752b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000001$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"65\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/d/50d77d88aadedd5d0c523057a0500ce355d8197e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99\\cdot10101$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"14\" /> evaluates to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/e/d1e03516f20a1788b9bc2c80c6ab1f1edeb9cecc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$999999$\" width=\"53\" height=\"12\" />. The difference is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/5/e15c66c776c0a530de135731e110cad3a03c94cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"63\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>Solution by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Juwushu\" title=\"User:Juwushu\">juwushu</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Distributive_Property.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Distributive_Property)\">Solution 2 (Distributive Property)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Distributive Property)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/6/ff68bba2f852de148c1779b3593c4ca6ffb3afed.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 9901\\cdot101-99\\cdot10101 &amp;= (10000-99)\\cdot101-99\\cdot(10000+101) \\\\ &amp;= 10000\\cdot101-99\\cdot101-99\\cdot10000-99\\cdot101 \\\\ &amp;= (10000\\cdot101-99\\cdot10000)-2\\cdot(99\\cdot101) \\\\ &amp;= 2\\cdot10000-2\\cdot9999 \\\\ &amp;= \\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }2}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"544\" height=\"129\" />\n~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Solution_1_but_Distributive.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Solution_1_but_Distributive)\">Solution 3 (Solution 1 but Distributive)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Solution 1 but Distributive)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/4/c349d42dc938f2f81d2fdbe00de6ab93db86b21d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9901\\cdot101=9901\\cdot100+9901=990100+9901=1000001$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"463\" height=\"15\" /> and  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/8/bf8fdf49a0c127984b4df80350b68e46cddcc2c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99\\cdot10101=100\\cdot10101-10101=1010100-10101=999999$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"491\" height=\"15\" />, therefore the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/8/f2830614b3e3362bda8828daf98fba71a1738dfc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000001-999999=\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"223\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~Tacos_are_yummy_1\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_4_.28Modular_Arithmetic.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_(Modular_Arithmetic)\">Solution 4 (Modular Arithmetic)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 (Modular Arithmetic)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Evaluating the given expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/4/22463bfe33cdaece746532048ba191f09e2694c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pmod{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"79\" height=\"18\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/7/ce7531a40722d06dc7fa52f9138c548accc8d8b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1-9\\equiv 2 \\pmod{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"157\" height=\"20\" />, so the answer is either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/6/a46f6af01fcf3bb5f6cac2316bc4de9bb3906bec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/0/b305929a95b53f14a0ad53eba1d8560626e1f28b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" />. Evaluating <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/6/f96a2e1273c7052c2c53223346a8cd5b4c535465.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pmod{101}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"92\" height=\"20\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/f/cffa37342d9b449bdbe298505abc059f230a13f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0-99\\equiv 2\\pmod{101}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"175\" height=\"20\" />. Because answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/0/b305929a95b53f14a0ad53eba1d8560626e1f28b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/8/068b7c1922839ae175584270e707f272af03dcb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$202=2\\cdot 101$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"103\" height=\"14\" />, that cannot be the answer, so we choose choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/3/a83327d2dffcf40a2a6c6815d397a28a208480a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"58\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_5_.28Process_of_Elimination.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5_(Process_of_Elimination)\">Solution 5 (Process of Elimination)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5 (Process of Elimination)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We simply look at the units digit of the problem we have (or take mod <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />)\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/e/c8ec864e059d92cfd87d3afbeeb0f6ced81dbe23.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[9901\\cdot101-99\\cdot10101 \\equiv 1\\cdot1 - 9\\cdot1 = 2 \\mod{10}.\\]\" width=\"398\" height=\"12\" />\nSince the only answers with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in the units digit are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/6/a46f6af01fcf3bb5f6cac2316bc4de9bb3906bec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/0/b305929a95b53f14a0ad53eba1d8560626e1f28b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" />, we can then continue if you are desperate to use guess and check or an actually valid method to find the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/3/a83327d2dffcf40a2a6c6815d397a28a208480a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"58\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Mathkiddus\" title=\"User:Mathkiddus\">mathkiddus</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_6_.28Faster_Distribution.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_6_(Faster_Distribution)\">Solution 6 (Faster Distribution)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 6 (Faster Distribution)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Observe that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/3/56335d102072cdaca9eefc172e424ff2c2010738.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9901=9900+1=99\\cdot100+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"244\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/f/03fafb1b1103dece98af9d3d009152c60a9f6782.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10101=10100+1=101\\cdot100+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"272\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/5/e255ec99406ce627b82dcb9f7a566340a83373f8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\Rightarrow9901\\cdot101-99\\cdot10101 &amp; = ((9900\\cdot101)+(1\\cdot101))-((99\\cdot10100)+(99\\cdot1)) \\\\ &amp;=(99\\cdot100\\cdot101)+101-(99\\cdot100\\cdot101)-99 \\\\ &amp;=101-99 \\\\ &amp;=\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }2}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"616\" height=\"104\" />\n</p><p>~laythe_enjoyer211\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_7_.28Cubes.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_7_(Cubes)\">Solution 7 (Cubes)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 7 (Cubes)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/8/6d8f8e9675091b6c67807f22cedce7360d82b43f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=100$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" />. Then, we have\n\\begin{align*}\n101\\cdot 9901=(x+1)\\cdot (x^2-x+1)=x^3+1, \\\\\n99\\cdot 10101=(x-1)\\cdot (x^2+x+1)=x^3-1.\n\\end{align*}\nThen, the answer can be rewritten as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/e/83e24b14493173a4b9c0682a2cf7c38b84047529.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x^3+1)-(x^3-1)= \\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"236\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~erics118\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_8_.28Super_Fast.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_8_(Super_Fast)\">Solution 8 (Super Fast)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 8 (Super Fast)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>It's not hard to observe and express <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/1/e61ce09efe3f712dc81b4013adc833fb23dbb813.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9901$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/7/1b7b624e0693e1eee10389e1237bc3f146e4d3de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99\\cdot100+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"92\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/b/80bdf16a63fd5c8c8170ed00016aaff3badb5e58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10101$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/b/c2b38815bfaadf7f1a40e810f259daa155b791b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$101\\cdot100+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"101\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>We then simplify the original expression into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/4/fc4057c5eff52d429b8ee42ea081c3a73f9a0fc3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(99\\cdot100+1)\\cdot101-99\\cdot(101\\cdot100+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"313\" height=\"20\" />, which could then be simplified into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/f/38fdcd7c74b5a8bbf944f8bd5cf5a76be5e25973.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99\\cdot100\\cdot101+101-99\\cdot100\\cdot101-99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"312\" height=\"15\" />, which we can get the answer of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/3/e535f4335857fbd770167a85522537988b92ee57.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$101-99=\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"150\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~RULE101\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_9_.28Estimation.29_.2A.F0.9F.94.A5VERY_FAST.F0.9F.94.A5.2A\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_9_(Estimation)_*🔥VERY_FAST🔥*\">Solution 9 (Estimation) *🔥VERY FAST🔥*</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 9 (Estimation) *🔥VERY FAST🔥*\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that the answer choices are significantly different in value. This allows us to estimate the answer. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/1/e61ce09efe3f712dc81b4013adc833fb23dbb813.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9901$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> is about <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/4/9f4f407fa86791b87ad5286ea377c10b2111d0f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"47\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/b/94bb6fb7a3ff722532798b45607025254679e7b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$101$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> is about <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/1/a313bf06349648df7be807bee95b651604ce7a7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is about <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/b/80bdf16a63fd5c8c8170ed00016aaff3badb5e58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10101$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" /> is about <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/4/9f4f407fa86791b87ad5286ea377c10b2111d0f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"47\" height=\"14\" />. Computing, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/0/b4072f6bd499056a6b78359ee280060a5fbb70c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10000 \\cdot 100-100 \\cdot 10000 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"229\" height=\"15\" />. The closest answer to this estimation is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/3/a83327d2dffcf40a2a6c6815d397a28a208480a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"58\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_10\">Solution 10</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 10\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can see that the units digit of the expression is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/1/d219154d95b51cb12d4d62e1ccf6e7ee57ddf80f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 - 9 \\Rightarrow 11 - 9 \\Rightarrow 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"157\" height=\"15\" />, elimination options B, C, and E. Next, notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/4/88488e126ed613e3795a73c3a52f7860cd55068a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(9901)(101)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"94\" height=\"20\" /> is divisible by 101 while <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/6/ce6ea69ee903180380735f6d6c5eb37840fab314.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(99)(10101)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"94\" height=\"20\" /> is not divisible by 101 (to see this, notice that 101 is prime, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/1/e212089f7ddd39a2956e3b7f2eae19402f8a3315.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10101 = 10100 + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"148\" height=\"15\" />, so is not divisible by 101). This means that the final answer is not divisible by 101, eliminating <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/0/b305929a95b53f14a0ad53eba1d8560626e1f28b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/3/a83327d2dffcf40a2a6c6815d397a28a208480a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"58\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_11_.28Fastest.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_11_(Fastest)\">Solution 11 (Fastest)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 11 (Fastest)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/e/5de06082f7e3543167163bfaea6964488d57ee55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9901*101$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"83\" height=\"14\" /> ends in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/d/a1d3858190f99c54d76a7f8ed89e849e1a3d9d39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99*10101$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"83\" height=\"14\" /> ends in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> so the answer must end in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/6/856e118f653b631ad889681bfd6ee051bd6b0c07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1-9) \\equiv -8 \\equiv 2\\pmod{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"218\" height=\"20\" />, which only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/3/a83327d2dffcf40a2a6c6815d397a28a208480a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"58\" height=\"30\" /> satisfies.\n~pandapower24\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Z76bafQsqTc\">https://youtu.be/Z76bafQsqTc</a>\n</p><p>~Thesmartgreekmathdude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_DDM\">Video Solution DDM</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=14\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution DDM\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/2Mb2Nahpb_A\">https://youtu.be/2Mb2Nahpb_A</a>\n</p><p>~piggydude\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution.28Don.27t_do_the_actual_computation-_be_fast_by_taking_mods.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution(Don't_do_the_actual_computation-_be_fast_by_taking_mods!)\">Video Solution(Don't do the actual computation- be fast by taking mods!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=15\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution(Don&#39;t do the actual computation- be fast by taking mods!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/l3VrUsZkv8I\">https://youtu.be/l3VrUsZkv8I</a> \n</p><p>~MC\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Central_Valley_Math_Circle\">Video Solution by Central Valley Math Circle</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=16\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Central Valley Math Circle\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/eLs748wDmMs\">https://youtu.be/eLs748wDmMs</a>\n</p><p>~mr_mathman\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28.E2.9A.A1.EF.B8.8F_1_min_solve_.E2.9A.A1.EF.B8.8F.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(⚡️_1_min_solve_⚡️)\">Video Solution (⚡️ 1 min solve ⚡️)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=17\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (⚡️ 1 min solve ⚡️)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/RODYXdpipdc\">https://youtu.be/RODYXdpipdc</a>\n</p><p><i>~Education, the Study of Everything </i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Pi_Academy\">Video Solution by Pi Academy</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=18\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Pi Academy\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/GPoTfGAf8bc?si=JYDhLVzfHUbXa3DW\">https://youtu.be/GPoTfGAf8bc?si=JYDhLVzfHUbXa3DW</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_FrankTutor\">Video Solution by FrankTutor</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=19\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by FrankTutor\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ez095SvW5xI\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ez095SvW5xI</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_Power_Solve\">Video Solution 1 by Power Solve</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=20\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 by Power Solve\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j-37jvqzhrg\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j-37jvqzhrg</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_SpreadTheMathLove\">Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=21\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6SQ74nt3ynw\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6SQ74nt3ynw</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math_from_my_desk\">Video Solution by Math from my desk</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=22\" title=\"